<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>auto type ez in chat</Major>
    <Description>This macro (auto key) will make you type in Roblox's chat the word "ez", easy as in for short. The word "ez" means saying Easy in a very harsh/toxic way. This can be used for enemies who annoy or for fun/ragebaiting. It is recommended to go with the "auto type gg" macro as it is less harsh than this, but i am not stopping you. I am not responsible for anything that will happen to you. The keys are - ( P/ R/ Pe Re Pz Rz PEnter REnter).</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 56 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyUp 56 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 24 ms
KeyDown 88 1
Delay 22
KeyUp 88 1
Delay 22</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>